{
  "statement": "The proposed requirements from GreenAgent are essential for promoting sustainability within the bookkeeping system. GRN-01 focuses on minimizing energy consumption, which is vital for reducing operational costs and environmental impact. GRN-02 emphasizes the importance of cloud solutions to lessen the carbon footprint. GRN-03 advocates for document digitization, significantly reducing paper usage. GRN-04 tracks resource impacts, fostering continuous improvement. GRN-05 provides transparency through sustainability reports, helping users make informed decisions. GRN-06 enables users to offset carbon emissions, actively contributing to climate action, while GRN-07 ensures compliance with sustainability regulations, promoting responsible practices in financial systems.",
