      "description": "Minimizing energy consumption (GRN-01) may conflict with optimizing transaction processing speed (EFF-01), as faster processing could require more energy."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["GRN-02", "SAF-04"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Implementing cloud-based solutions (GRN-02) may conflict with comprehensive error handling mechanisms (SAF-04) if not properly managed, potentially leading to data integrity issues."
    },
